# The Savage (battlefield.savage, Monarch Linn: a BattlefieldMission, index 1, 30 minutes, six players, entry NPC
# SD_Entrance). A level 75 Warrior of San d'Oria with The Savage current and its Status 1 (GMs), who came from Riverne -
# Site #A01: entryRequirement refuses (the previous zone is A01): no options. Back in from Riverne - Site #B01: the menu
# 32000; area 1 (option 17): entered. Ouryu (area 1's) spawns at the first tick; killed: allDeath sets WON; the win:
# battlefieldWin, 32001; finished: the mission's handler (Status 1, the win: Status 2), the Mist Melter title, 1500 XP.
lists MonarchLinn/SD_Entrance/onTrigger MonarchLinn/onEventUpdate/32000 MonarchLinn/onEventFinish/32000 MonarchLinn/onEventFinish/32001
char zone=RiverneSiteA01 pos=0,0,0 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
mission Cop TheSavage current
charvar Mission[6][418]Status 1
login
warp -39.1,-3.3,-537 MonarchLinn        # from A01
trigger SD_Entrance                     # refused
warp 0,0,0 RiverneSiteB01
warp -39.1,-3.3,-537 MonarchLinn        # from B01
trigger SD_Entrance                     # the menu 32000
update 32000 option=17                  # index 1, area 1: entered
finish                                  # in the arena
tick 2000                               # Ouryu spawns
kill OURYU                              # allDeath: WON; 32001
finish                                  # Status 2
tick 11000
tick 10000
